### **9. Complete Hover Flow Diagram**

```
User hovers over 3D piece
        ↓
ModelPiece.onPointerEnter fires
        ↓
handlePointerEnter() called
        ↓
hoverPiece(piece.guid) dispatch
        ↓
DesignAppStore updates hover state { pieces: [pieceGuid] }
        ↓
HoverPiecesProvider listens via useSyncExternalStore
        ↓
computeHoverData() recalculates:
  - transitivelyHoveredPieces (adds piece + related)
  - transitivelyHoveredTypes (adds piece's type)
        ↓
useDesignAppIsPieceTransitiveHovered() subscribers re-render
        ↓
ModelPiece re-computes highlightColor
        ↓
applyHighlightToLoadedScene() updates THREE.Color materials
        ↓
Mesh materials change to hoverBaseColor
        ↓
User sees visual highlight on 3D piece

User moves away
        ↓
ModelPiece.onPointerLeave fires
        ↓
handlePointerLeave() called
        ↓
clearHover() dispatch
        ↓
Repeat from step 3 onwards with undefined hover state
```

